      "content": "wait 325mg of aspirin? is that enough for a clot?? i'm kinda scared now. do i really need to go to the hospital right away or can i just try the aspirin and see if the chest tightness goes away first? i dont really want to sit in an A&E for 8 hours if it's just something minor",
